.TH "ARC-IDENTIFY" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-identify \- identify archive format
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc identify FILE...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Detect archive/compression format using content first and the filename suffix only as a hint or fallback.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-F, \-\-format FORMAT
.PP
\-\-json
.PP
\-\-execution MODE
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arc identify mystery.bin
.PP
arc identify a.zip b.tar.zst \-\-json
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc(1), arc\-formats(7), arc\-backends(7), arc\-remote(7)
